                                    through regular site visits and spot checks.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
                            <div class="services__item">
                                <img src="/theme_hiroto/static/src/img/services/services-4.png" alt=""/>
